<body>

  <article itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Recipe">
    <h1 itemprop="name">No-Bake Peanut Butter &amp; Banana Granola Bites</h1>

    <div class="meta-info">
      <p>⏱️ <strong>Prep Time:</strong> <time itemprop="prepTime" datetime="PT10M">10 minutes</time></p>
      <p>🥣 <strong>Yield:</strong> <span itemprop="recipeYield">12-15 bite-sized balls</span></p>
    </div>

    <p itemprop="description">
      A fast, 10-minute no-bake school snack packed with rolled oats, honey, banana, and peanut butter for steady energy.
    </p>

    <h2>Ingredients</h2>
    <ul>
      <li itemprop="recipeIngredient">1 cup rolled oats</li>
      <li itemprop="recipeIngredient">1/2 cup creamy peanut butter (or SunButter / WowButter for nut-free)</li>
      <li itemprop="recipeIngredient">1/3 cup honey</li>
      <li itemprop="recipeIngredient">1/2 ripe banana, thoroughly mashed</li>
      <li itemprop="recipeIngredient">1/2 tsp vanilla extract</li>
      <li itemprop="recipeIngredient">Optional mix-ins: 2 tbsp mini chocolate chips, chia seeds, or ground flaxseed</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Instructions</h2>
    <ol itemprop="recipeInstructions">
      <li>In a medium bowl, stir together the rolled oats, peanut butter, honey, mashed banana, and vanilla extract until completely combined.</li>
      <li>Place the bowl in the refrigerator for 15–20 minutes to make the mixture easier to roll.</li>
      <li>Roll the mixture into 1-inch, bite-sized balls using your hands.</li>
      <li>Place the bites in an airtight container and store in the refrigerator for up to 7 days.</li>
    </ol>
  </article>

